# Build context for Dockerfile.api. BuildKit reads `<dockerfile>.dockerignore`
# in preference to `.dockerignore`, so each image states its own context and
# neither has to share a root file with the old trees.
#
# Everything is excluded and the directories the image needs are allowed back in.
# A deny list would silently ship whatever the next lane adds.
#
# Lane G4 adds three more, and G3a's `crm` is needed by all of them.
#
# The rule this list follows is "every directory the entry point reaches
# **transitively**", not "every directory apps/api/src names". `@fss/domain/dial`
# imports from `../crm`, `../policy` and `../suppression`; `../suppression`
# imports from `../crm` and `../policy` in turn. A list built from the
# application's own import statements would have shipped `dial` and nothing it
# stands on, and the container would fail at load with ERR_MODULE_NOT_FOUND.
*

!package.json
!package-lock.json
!apps/api/package.json
!apps/api/src
!packages/domain/package.json
!packages/domain/crm
!packages/domain/db
!packages/domain/jobs
!packages/domain/research
!packages/domain/today
!packages/domain/src
!packages/domain/policy
!packages/domain/suppression
!packages/domain/classification
!packages/domain/mail
!packages/domain/outbound
!packages/domain/dial
!packages/domain/sequences
!packages/domain/templates
!packages/domain/settings
!packages/domain/dashboard
!packages/contracts/package.json
!packages/contracts/src

# The harness starts a PostgreSQL cluster and belongs to the test run, never
# to an image, and no test or fixture is part of a production container.
# `research/testing` holds the recorded provider fixtures and is not matched by
# `**/test/**`, so it is named here as well.
packages/domain/db/testing
packages/domain/research/testing
**/*.test.ts
**/test/**
**/node_modules
**/.DS_Store
